-- Source module: Solutions.KIL6Pad
/-!
# KIL6: one-field padding and extraction as IL loops

* `padP`: on stack `0` an array `xs` of `X · (F · Y)` entries (`[X, F, Y]`, row-major); it
  produces `padL X F F' Y 0 xs` (every block of `F · Y` entries followed by `(F' - F) · Y`
